  "meta": {
    "intent": "Bass clang control. Fundamental-friendly HPF and restrained upper-clang taming.",
    "gain_conscious": true,
    "design_notes": "Tight Cut at 40 Hz protects the low fundamental without sub removal. Band 1 HPF (35 Hz, 24 dB/oct) is the only high-pass; 60 Hz bell at unity for fundamental visibility. 800 Hz notch parked at 0 dB for box/clang (user dials depth). Mild -3 dB high-shelf at 2.5 kHz only. No stacked boosts; outputGain/outputTrim at unity."
  }
